<title>MONACO: SOCCER-MONACO V NEWCASTLE TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MONACO V NEWCASTLE TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Tuesday's UEFA Cup quarter-final second leg match between Monaco of France and Newcastle United of England:</p>
<p>Monaco: 1-Fabien Barthez; 2-Patrick Blondeau, 5-Franck Dumas, 4-Martin Djetou, 18-Gilles Grimandi, 6-Emmanuel Petit; 15-Sylvain Legwinski, 8-Ali Benarbia, 7-John Collins; 9-Sonny Anderson, 28-Thierry Henry.</p>
<p>Newcastle: 15-Shaka Hislop; 19-Steve Watson, 5-Darren Peacock, 12-Philippe Albert, 21-Robbie Elliot; 2-Warren Barton, 4-David Batty, 7-Robert Lee, 14-David Ginola; 8-Peter Beardsley, 11-Faustino Asprilla.</p>
</text>
